  "descriptionShort": "Total [defined daily doses](#dod:defined-daily-doses) of AWaRe category: Not classified/recommended used per 1000 inhabitants per day.  The use of the Not classified/Not recommended antibiotics is not evidence-based, nor recommended in high-quality international guidelines. WHO does not recommend the use of these antibiotics in clinical practice.",
  "descriptionProcessing": "We add doses from each route of administration to get the total doses for each AWaRe category. The route of administration can be one of the following: orally administered, parenterally administered, rectally administered, or inhaled.",
